module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.receipt_whose_competent_refuter_is_absent

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data receipt_whose_competent_refuter_is_absent: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "receipt_whose_competent_refuter_is_absent" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a receipt is written about work done ELSEWHERE, is true-looking, and nothing in its audience would red if it were wrong** (INVALID STATE: a claim about another party's work, another lane's finding, or another program's state is filed to an audience from which THE ONLY PARTY POSITIONED TO FALSIFY IT IS ABSENT. HARM: the claim enters the record with the standing of a receipt and the evidentiary weight of an assertion, and because nothing downstream disagrees with it, it is never revisited; later work is planned against it. ",

    "**THE GENERATOR IS NOT THE TEXT, IT IS THE AUDIENCE: who can falsify this claim, and are they in the room?** Every other tell -- confidence, specificity, whether it cites a run -- is a property of the wording, and a wrong claim written carefully has all of them. The audience is the only property that predicts whether an error survives, and it is knowable BEFORE the claim is made rather than after it is contradicted. ",

    "**SPECIMEN ONE, THE SUBJECT EXCLUDED.** A lane close-out credited a catch to the wrong lane. The only party positioned to know it was wrong was its SUBJECT, who was not an addressee. Two aggravating facts, and they compound: a close-out is written at the exact moment its subject STOPS BEING REACHABLE, so the default order of operations removes the competent refuter from the room precisely when the claim is made; and it was a CREDIT claim, so no recipient had any motive to interrogate it. ",

    "**SPECIMEN TWO, THE DISINTERESTED EXCLUDED, reported against their own conduct by the manager it happened to.** A peer manager sent a finding -- thirty qualified spellings, unmarked, no line stop. It was RANKED ABOVE A MEASURED POPULATION without its provenance being checked. It was false. The diagnosis of why review failed is the load-bearing part: the claim FLATTERED BOTH PROGRAMS, so the two readers were not independent, THEY WERE TWO BENEFICIARIES. It took a lane with no stake in either program reading the commit body to find it. ",

    "**THE TWO SPECIMENS ARE ONE OBJECT, WHICH IS WHY BOTH ARE KEPT.** A credit claim and a claim that serves its reader's own program look nothing alike and fail identically: an assertion whose audience has no MOTIVE to interrogate it is in the same state as one whose audience has no POSITION to. Either alone reads as a manners problem -- be careful about credit, be sceptical of good news. Together they show the defect is structural and about composition of the audience, not about the virtue of its members. ",

    "**BOUNDARIES AGAINST THREE ROSTERED NEIGHBOURS, because the nearest one is nearer than it looks.** `admission_predicate_evidenced_from_inside_its_own_subject` is the closest and is the same shape ONE LAYER IN: there a SURFACE has no vocabulary for what would falsify the rule, so the predicate cannot be represented as false; here an AUDIENCE has no position or motive to produce the falsification, so it is never attempted. Surface versus readership. `corroboration_without_an_independent_derivation_axis` is about two readings sharing an EVIDENCE LINEAGE -- a reader can move the derivation axis and still be a beneficiary, and two disinterested readers can share an axis, so the two rows are independent. `window_rendered_subject_misattribution` is an identity taken from material a RENDERER placed near the change, and `receipt_names_a_property_not_the_tree_it_holds_of` is a receipt expiring when its BASE moves; both are about the claim's derivation, this is about its readership. ",

    "**THE REMEDY IS A QUORUM PRACTICE AND NOTHING EXECUTES OVER IT, WHICH MUST BE SAID IN THE SAME BREATH AS THE PRACTICE.** The practice: before filing a receipt about work done elsewhere, send it to the party whose work it describes, and do it while they are still reachable. Nothing enforces this. No gate reads the addressee list of a message, no lens can tell a claim ABOUT another lane from a claim about one's own, and a close-out is the one artifact written when routing to the subject is hardest. A row that stated the practice without this sentence would be the inert lens this roster already warns about -- rung honesty applies to the roster's own rows, and specification-without-execution does not stop being that when the specification is a social one. ",

    "**BOTH SPECIMENS WERE CAUGHT BY ACCIDENT, AND THE ACCIDENTS ARE THE EVIDENCE FOR THE RUNG.** One because the subject happened to be in the audience; one because an uninvolved lane happened to read a commit body. Neither is a mechanism, neither is repeatable, and neither would have fired had the accident not occurred. RUNG FOUND AT: below the ladder. CEILING: mitigatable, and the reason is that the falsifying party is external to the modelled system -- DESIGN section 4b's adjacent column, outside the modelled guarantee, observed or refused at a declared boundary rather than proven. NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, NAMED AS A CAPABILITY rather than as an artifact: a filing route for cross-lane claims that CANNOT COMPLETE without an acknowledged addressee who is the claim's subject, sufficient that a receipt about another party's work has no unaddressed form -- at which point the invalid state is unwritable rather than discouraged. ",

    "**TWO PROCESS FACTS ABOUT THIS ROW'S OWN AUTHORSHIP, kept because they are instances of what it describes.** The row was DRAFTED BY ANOTHER LANE AND DISCARDED UNPUSHED when routing assigned it here -- landing it would have created a second authority for a row already assigned, committed out of momentum at the last possible moment, which is the defect that lane had spent the day on. And the wording of the class is tidy-heron-873's, who DECLINED CREDIT THEY WERE OFFERED, which is the only reason the correction to specimen one existed to be sent at all. A row about claims nobody is positioned to refute exists because someone refused a claim in their own favour. ",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
